            "value": "不可"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shop or facility name (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "店舗・施設名（任意）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening hours, if you know them (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "営業時間（わかれば・任意）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About this place": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この場所について"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Say what the smoking place is, not only what shop is there: a convenience store or café by itself is not a smoking place. Names and hours are only for the reviewer and are deleted after 90 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "店舗名だけでなく、喫煙場所そのもの（灰皿・喫煙室など）を選んでください。コンビニや喫茶店があるだけでは喫煙場所になりません。店名や営業時間は審査担当者だけが確認し、90日後に削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reviewer compares this with other reports and sources. One report never changes the listing by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "審査担当者が他の報告や情報源と照らし合わせます。1件の報告だけで掲載内容が変わることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %lld m from your pin · tap to confirm it is still here instead": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ピンから約%lldm · タップすると新規追加の代わりに「ここにありました」を送ります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a smoking place": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "喫煙場所を追加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Been here recently? Your check helps others. It is reviewed before anything changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近ここに来ましたか？あなたの確認が他の人の役に立ちます。掲載内容は審査の後にのみ変わります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before adding a new place, check whether it is already listed. If it is a different place nearby, keep adding it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しく追加する前に、すでに載っていないか確認してください。近くの別の場所なら、そのまま追加を続けてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キャンセル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the correction: choose the value you saw, or remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修正内容を確認してください。見た内容を選ぶか、削除してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirmed by %lld users": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "利用者%lld人が確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delivery could not be confirmed. The confirmation may already have been received; it stays saved on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "送信を確認できませんでした。すでに受信されている可能性があります。この端末に保存されたままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish or discard your saved report first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先に保存中の報告を送信するか破棄してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't find it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "見つかりませんでした"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you know a smoking place here, you can add it for review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この付近の喫煙場所を知っていれば、審査用に追加できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you pass one, you can tell others whether it is still there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通りかかったら、まだあるかどうかを他の人に伝えられます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is it one of these?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これではありませんか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has been removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撤去されています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was here": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここにありました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's a different kind of place": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "種類が違います"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Know a smoking place that isn't listed? Pin it and say what is there. It is reviewed before it can appear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "載っていない喫煙場所を知っていますか？ピンを置いて何があるかを教えてください。掲載前に審査されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On-site check": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現地確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pin a smoking place that is missing from the map. It is reviewed before it can appear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地図にない喫煙場所をピンで追加します。掲載前に審査されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Places nearby waiting for confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "近くに確認待ちの場所があります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reported by one user · no one else has confirmed it yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "利用者報告 · まだ他の利用者による確認なし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認を送信"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends a confirmation that this place still exists, for review": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この場所がまだあることを確認として送ります（審査されます）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show places waiting for confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認待ちの場所を表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something is different": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "違う点を報告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for checking. Confirmations may be reflected after review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認ありがとうございます。審査後に反映される場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for your report. It may be reflected after review; the listing has not changed yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "報告ありがとうございます。確認後に反映される場合があります。掲載内容はまだ変わっていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exact spot could use a check": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正確な位置の確認待ち"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This kind of report isn't available yet. Choose another report type or use Other correction.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この種類の報告はまだ利用できません。別の種類か「その他の修正」を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for someone to confirm it's still here": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだあるかの確認待ち"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What did you see? (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実際はどうでしたか？（任意）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it actually is": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実際の種類"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What kind of place it is is unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "種類が不明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who can actually use it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実際の利用条件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who can use it is unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "利用条件が不明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're confirming that this smoking place is still here. Nothing else about you or your location is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この喫煙場所がまだあることを確認します。あなた自身や現在地の情報は送信されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A report may not be used. It is shown as a user report, never as official information.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "報告が採用されない場合もあります。採用された情報は利用者報告として表示され、公式情報としては表示されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read the full terms": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規約の全文を読む"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full terms": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規約の全文"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
